  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/02/P14002681.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>El Caf&egrave; Druida, en la calle Ausi&agrave;s March, 45 de Onda, ha acogido la noche de este viernes el concierto del grupo Versiones XX, capitaneado por el ondense C&eacute;sar P&eacute;rez Castell&oacute;.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/02/P14003181.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>La noche ha estado animada, con baile de Nacho Ribes Mu&ntilde;oz y Fortunato Garcia Piquer junto a la vocalista, incluido.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/02/P1400321.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Al final ha habido hasta una mini jam session, con Berna Novella a la bater&iacute;a, Andr&eacute;s Mauricio Bedoya al bajo y Joan Fonfria a la guitarra.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertversionsxxdruida120216/p1400263.jpg\" alt=\"p1400263\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertversionsxxdruida120216/p1400266.jpg\" alt=\"p1400266\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertversionsxxdruida120216/p1400268.jpg\" alt=\"p1400268\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertversionsxxdruida120216/p1400269.jpg\" alt=\"p1400269\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertversionsxxdruida120216/p1400270.jpg\" alt=\"p1400270\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertversionsxxdruida120216/p1400272.jpg\" alt=\"p1400272\